  "instruction": "Peak Index",
  "output": "    public static int peakIndex(int[] arr){\n        int i=0;\n        int j= arr.length-1;\n\n        while (i<=j){\n            int m = (i+j)/2;\n            if (arr[m] < arr[m+1]) i=m+1;\n            else j=m-1;\n        }\n\n        return i;\n    }",
